#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/silicon.rst:601
msgid ""
"The RTA neglects the in-scattering term of the collision operator and "
"therefore underestimates :math:`\\kappa` of crystals in which Normal "
"processes are important (see :ref:`this page <kappa_beyond_rta>`). To "
